{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1101","t":"Hello,\n\nThis is my first time when I am posting on this site. I began to do my homeworks so if anyone from the masters can give me a feedback I will be very happy.\n\nThank you!","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1101","p":45,"im":["8eb288df03b2af9a363e528fbc4952f556940cee","22bcc1edd83f9fb88555e719d1d2b5673e8e4c07","f8ca0ccc878985a2d12a293a2d9d7ff3b686f1cf","1dd89168917064defe4dc500b80a7f9376731a4d","d6b114c8e87a92d3d3ad16fa919de4352c90db07"],"m":1101},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1102","t":"","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1102","p":45,"im":["66a64d27bb54ba0034bf177d60751ca80e6e0156","e827c5e2a3c75225b02cddea298945b339622fc4"],"m":1102},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1103","t":"Hi everyone,\n\nSame here, first participation and very first homework! When the text is in Orange, it is a direct question to teachers/other traders. Answers and comments highly appreciated!\n\nThanks This is EURJPY Monthly\n\nAnd on the image below, some other RDB DBR, with another question. (I didn't mark a lot of them, to make the chart clearer)","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1103","p":45,"im":["7f39727c370ad62c3f20ef9854a5ce3d76c9d244","05cf1923145e4efbc3020a3bbab62ef2ba1fced4"],"m":1103},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1104","t":"Another 50...","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1104","p":45,"im":["7a8a2dae60307d99dec3fa380fd1a66e4644d212","2f7d52da67427bdd5697dfc1d718f43de7916e57","0d6fe31133cb3d31fdfbd7a8636a47b33579cb67","23b53e021a0beba67969272496d4bc638e1909de","faf9e7e87dbda27c31260ca2a5b7f9a365147f37","7ffdc223eac172bcc8a30094a1cf20ebe5c02428"],"m":1104},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1105","t":"Trader05, I find your way of drawing RDB and DBR way simpler than mine, I think I'll take example of you ^^","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1105","p":45,"im":[],"m":1105},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1106","t":"Hey Greywind! Here are some of my thoughts on your charts. Hopefully they answer your questions. There are some acronyms and terms that I'm not sure you've read about yet so I hope my notes aren't condescending. Pretty much every price turn on a chart can be classified as a RBD or DBR and the DBD RBR are often RBD or DBR on smaller time frames. If I missed what you were getting at please ask again. Cheers. Gaf","a":"antraxia","d":"","n":"#1106","p":45,"im":["f8c859f7e2ea370beb8a020385d8046e9a585e11","9bafde26e50caf671dd1bb31f7f8548a0dc7cf0c","dcf87daea13c00b031a6831d7eb2d876ac3d7e6f"],"m":1106},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1107","t":"Hi Antraxia, and a thousand thanks for your answer. Having this explanation before going to bed motivates me even more for tomorrow!\n\nYes, I was familiar with all the abreviations you used, so the explanation couldn't be clearer. Thanks again!","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1107","p":45,"im":[],"m":1107},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1108","t":"Awesome! Glad it helped. I find that I've been dreaming of this stuff for a while now (you will too) so that means its getting into our subconscious:). Cheers.","a":"antraxia","d":"","n":"#1108","p":45,"im":["f8c859f7e2ea370beb8a020385d8046e9a585e11"],"m":1108},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1109","t":"Another 50...","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1109","p":45,"im":["e56c56c7ebdaa8733035285b2dec3ae816b83adc","4824639f5c16c973b0cafdafa2a0df9b16c8c7d7","a9a01434dae41f44f3ae35aa19f734f6bf2b877d","766e736ecbee42467337b419f0f766a90fef721d","0c1d5ef2b94a666c7cdd9140b954f99a70064f04"],"m":1109},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1110","t":"Continued\n\nCount: 28 To go: 172 (oh my!)","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1110","p":45,"im":["3b9716044a24af0bc722e37a0845484d9ca97c73"],"m":1110},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1111","t":"To go: 139 ^^","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1111","p":45,"im":["f61514c3ce19c77bbd3720a1a6e029903c3c9365","9ad2d034f078b8d130a50a47e4bde408349145c8","7f6975d19b16bf090953bb80b28669f6e591f803","19a73131a095be71176324eb2bc867d6135fc89c"],"m":1111},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1112","t":"More homework:) Corrections, confirmations, suggestions, shotgun shots, all welcome! (Ok maybe not the shotgun shots\n\nCount: 100 setups Any way of improving for the second half of the homework?","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1112","p":45,"im":["dee2e17dc09cb49e49f7dc2c1e6c4846c154b26f","e7e357bd00f183e11bad85375307ca39c2e8b415","ba6cf2215499938b57a208e00f7aca429037db25","553bbb8aab8fee9c3af389af2d8a634eaac4fbb9"],"m":1112},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1113","t":"I am motivated today and here I come with some more\n\nCount: 154","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1113","p":45,"im":["7739b0ff5d90bd961cf175b5b069858c22306406","f718b9328e4857a573bf476d89f8306b611d85a1","e73b4346387f28b4d28ffb6a46a754834598e6e4","fc5cdae9964f9140cc8c18be2a89e77b397a9ec9"],"m":1113},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1114","t":"Continued (and end) as I reach my 200th setup. I will do more of this without posting them, except if I have a question to ask or to answer\n\nLet's say 50 or 100 more tonight, before going for the next lesson and homework","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#1114","p":45,"im":["4913491610443f74beafdfbe2ba194452569b7ef","9088c521ccde7079cf1813f973df639797e50dad","916e0bdf0f9a657474d532be6a64fb788a1a5847","99a734b182d4f612148d345f0b8766c89e2b6ec5","5a2eecbf172497cb0af935dda67075c3a07f9dd8"],"m":1114},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1115","t":"The last 50 and still no feedback on this homework....","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1115","p":45,"im":["3367acf4b1b656db08b544e4f0a75111c6c0fd25","24ec7fb7415d2564624625e95876902bae6ba6e7","531eef6e476b1f5a27011be73a703534ab2fbb60","60f5ead06b1740506174ab7cce103f94f08afd71","e11985b3f1a0fda1b9bd55cb95f47b46da96d2a4"],"m":1115},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1116","t":"no need for feedback really. you guys are doing fine on this. its s simple exercise to tune your eyes to sweep across the chart and see what happens at these areas. then move on other subjects to study","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#1116","p":45,"im":[],"m":1116},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1117","t":"Thank you, Harry!","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#1117","p":45,"im":[],"m":1117},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1118","t":"Posting up some homework!\n\nwhew:)","a":"Duds","d":"","n":"#1118","p":45,"im":["2a4e127ad992b78db45538bcc5d818e98b1a4be3","b9a8caef6eb046e283fb3cea9d31c6a8e865b452","dc91489b9b43b780efd000353acbbc6bba2d788a","acda963f8f3b388515439d584ca8488b97ea0fe9","bb87ca14324b925d92f4771c235c7793a77f1d91","7871924548e018dc9e21e66150b91545ec3a5b05","75134eebe1b156b6db679d5f31696bb2c1b41731","7f93d7a55544cb93256a27ce71d9ced37f7da0dc","49b14b50a356e31e58bd2c2c2000ac4b13025812","cbbda92354d649c8d92b9b8fcd0f923d34661513","fbb16a19ad7ff8a931f23883eb4554ca0db585eb","4d0de96b1bdad012a163394e8aa8e4a301c713c6"],"m":1118},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1119","t":"Hi\n\nTrying to post my chart here, can see?","a":"sds9808","d":"","n":"#1119","p":45,"im":[],"m":1119},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1120","t":"sds9808 wrote: Hi\n\nTrying to post my chart here, can see?\n\nNo I can't see it sorry.","a":"fxsniper","d":"","n":"#1120","p":45,"im":[],"m":1120},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1121","t":"Right first go at some charts. Please don't laugh","a":"fxsniper","d":"","n":"#1121","p":45,"im":["22eb0d8795bd3e471a29250f52fa47ed581204c4","23f9456f50890b1897dc12527a8ed27ddbe65c4f","2c3dae02a86592d40da272e72a0ccf5f944d6296"],"m":1121},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1122","t":"Dear IF & Team,\n\nI have marked most of the marking based on bases & base. I want to learn Flags and practice more flags method also in the coming days. I placed my first chart RBD & DBR in EURAUD H4.\n\nbye ajentha","a":"ajentha","d":"","n":"#1122","p":45,"im":["d118ba0428b58f894a8f97215cee3692ceeea3ae"],"m":1122},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1123","t":"Hello Everyone,\n\nThanks for the great training and thanks in advance for the help. I marked caps with checks, drew shaded areas across the caps and began to label DBR's and RBD's.\n\nThis is for the first homework:\n\nHomework: Mark at least 200 caps on your charts - there are so many to see that it won't take long. Draw a box from the cap to where price hit it later. Note how price approached the caps, and how it reacted. If price broke the cap, note what happened next. Was the cap still relevant?","a":"pipscout","d":"","n":"#1123","p":45,"im":["6d0a45e2b54866644768da278f60b4a861b6c28c","ec509c934790504f14401227cd929d73bc1a4692"],"m":1123},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1124","t":"Re-posting with the correct attachment method.:)\n\nHello Everyone,\n\nThanks for the great training and thanks in advance for the help. I marked caps with checks, drew shaded areas across the caps and began to label DBR's and RBD's.\n\nThis is for the first homework:\n\nHomework: Mark at least 200 caps on your charts - there are so many to see that it won't take long. Draw a box from the cap to where price hit it later. Note how price approached the caps, and how it reacted. If price broke the cap, note what happened next. Was the cap still relevant?","a":"pipscout","d":"","n":"#1124","p":45,"im":["6d0a45e2b54866644768da278f60b4a861b6c28c","ec509c934790504f14401227cd929d73bc1a4692"],"m":1124},{"id":"dbrrbd_p45_1125","t":"Dear Team,\n\nI am doing exercise 2 for Rally Bass Drop (RBD) & Drop base Rally (DBR)\n\nPlease comment my marking, then only I can learn\n\nbye ajentha","a":"ajentha","d":"","n":"#1125","p":45,"im":["c936fb846f79fcb184b083561e281d49811ce26e"],"m":1125}],"images":[{"k":"8eb288df03b2af9a363e528fbc4952f556940cee","t":"assets/thumbs/8eb288df03b2af9a363e528fbc4952f556940cee.webp","f":"assets/images/8eb288df03b2af9a363e528fbc4952f556940cee.png","w":1362,"h":668,"b":23882,"o":"8eb288df03b2af9a363e528fbc4952f556940cee.png","p":45,"pid":"dbrrbd_p45_1101"},{"k":"22bcc1edd83f9fb88555e719d1d2b5673e8e4c07","t":"assets/thumbs/22bcc1edd83f9fb88555e719d1d2b5673e8e4c07.webp","f":"assets/images/22bcc1edd83f9fb88555e719d1d2b5673e8e4c07.png","w":1363,"h":665,"b":25691,"o":"22bcc1edd83f9fb88555e719d1d2b5673e8e4c07.png","p":45,"pid":"dbrrbd_p45_1101"},{"k":"f8ca0ccc878985a2d12a293a2d9d7ff3b686f1cf","t":"assets/thumbs/f8ca0ccc878985a2d12a293a2d9d7ff3b686f1cf.webp","f":"assets/images/f8ca0ccc878985a2d12a293a2d9d7ff3b686f1cf.png","w":1364,"h":662,"b":24720,"o":"f8ca0ccc878985a2d12a293a2d9d7ff3b686f1cf.png","p":45,"pid":"dbrrbd_p45_1101"},{"k":"1dd89168917064defe4